@startuml
actor User
participant Controller
participant ClassService
participant ClassMapper

User -> Controller: 发起数据库操作请求
activate Controller
Controller -> ClassService: 调用operationClass方法
activate ClassService
ClassService -> ClassMapper: 根据操作类型执行数据库操作
activate ClassMapper
ClassMapper --> ClassService: 返回操作结果

alt 操作类型为 ADD
    ClassService -> ClassMapper: 执行插入操作
else 操作类型为 UPDATE
    ClassService -> ClassMapper: 执行更新操作
else 操作类型为 DELETE
    ClassService -> ClassMapper: 执行删除操作
end
deactivate ClassMapper
ClassService --> Controller: 返回操作结果
deactivate ClassService
Controller --> User: 返回操作结果
deactivate Controller

note over User: 用户接收操作结果并处理

@enduml
